name: Kogenta
website_url: https://www.kogenta.com/
privacy_policy_url: https://www.kogenta.com/privacy-policy/
privacy_contact: privacy@kogenta.com
country: GB
description: Kogenta is a location and movement data analytics company with offices in London and Oslo. It sells location data layers and audiences to advertising agencies, retailers and transport authorities. Its Kettle SDK (formerly PinchSDK and Pure SDK) is embedded in mobile apps and collects precise location, activity and Bluetooth beacon data. Its privacy policy says Kogenta acts as a GDPR processor on behalf of the app owner, based on the end user's consent, and that only aggregated, anonymised insights are shared with market participants. Data from several Kogenta-enabled apps on one device may be combined with separate consent.
